            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\dfrac{3}{4}$",
              "worked": "$\\begin{aligned}P(X>5)&=\\int_5^{10}\\frac{x}{50}\\,dx\\\\&=\\left[\\frac{x^2}{100}\\right]_5^{10}\\\\&=\\frac{100-25}{100}\\\\&=\\frac{3}{4}\\end{aligned}$",
